    "Condition : 1 - The proposed conversion of the single-family house to two 2-bedroom flats would result in the loss of a small family house for which there is an identified need in the Borough. The proposal would not provide satisfactory living accommodation for future residents, contrary to Council Supplementary Planning Guidance.  For these reasons, the proposal is contrary to adopted Unitary Development Plan policies ENV-B.1.1 (New Development), H.3.4 (Conversions of Houses to Flats) and H.4.1 (Housing Standards and Guidelines)."
